      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 28:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Man etimbre i ceng’ maeca, nia Jufilisti gicoko udul migi karacelo mir ali, kara gikied kud Israel. Man Akic uwacu ni Daudi kumae, Dong’ ing’ei andha, nia wabicidho wakudi kind udul, in ku dhanu peri. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.28.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.28.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 28:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "E Daudi wacu ni Akic kumae, Ka kumeno ibing’eyo gin ma jatic peri bitimo. Man Akic uwacu ni Daudi kumae, Ka kumeno abikethi ni jakur wia mi nja.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.28.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.28.2"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
